    <li><strong>Marriage register, entry No. 169 of 1956</strong>, form B.M.D. 3 (a) — <em>Kurt Luwinski and Frances Sefton, formerly Berner, born Hostovsky, 29 February 1956, Johannesburg, Transvaal</em>. Held in the MyHeritage tree as photo 9500001, catalogued there as <em>record-image_</em> and attached to Frances; original scan 3,918 × 5,245 px, read at full resolution 14 September 2026. Every field transcribed in <code>notes/marriage-register-1956.md</code>. The frame is plainly Johannesburg, whatever the film group is called.</li>
